  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the man as the speaker of the text",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the man in the image, who is visually depicted as the speaker of the text. The text uses 'I' to refer to the man, explicitly attributing the statement to him. This creates a direct analogical mapping where the viewer identifies with or imagines themselves as the man speaking the text, especially given the visual context of patriotism and the man's stern expression. The projection is onto the VisualMaterial entity 'man' and the TextualMaterial entity 'text_chunk_1'.",
